      "character": "Lash",
      "audioFile": "lash_match_start_lash_kelvin_convo03_04",
      "audioUrl": "audio/lash_match_start_lash_kelvin_convo03_04.mp3",
      "text": "Kelvin: where you there when I broke someone's left arm because they were right handed?  Or when I pointed out that a woman's baby looked stupid wearing a headband bow?  The Lash needs to be nicer? No\u2026 The lash is a humanitarian through and through",
